1. 网络连接 / Network Connection
   所有加密、解密操作均在本地设备完成。软件可能可选地检查更新或打开官网/
   API 文档，相关功能可在"设置"中关闭。软件不会上传文件内容、密码或个人
   信息。
   All encryption and decryption operations are performed locally on your
   device. The software may optionally check for updates or open the official
   website / API documentation; these features can be disabled in Settings.
   The software does not upload file contents, passwords, or personal
   information.

2. 合规使用 / Acceptable Use
   不得使用本软件隐藏、加密或传输非法内容（包括但不限于恶意软件、儿童色情
